SUMMARY:Gong Sound Journey & Astrology Transmission
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nAn immersive experience of Astrology & So
 und Alchemy.\n\n✨ **Star Sounds: A Sound Healing Journey with David Heis
 s**\n**An immersive experience of Astrology & Sound Alchemy**\nEnter the e
 vening where **cosmic intelligence meets vibrational healing**.\nWe begin 
 with a grounded yet intuitive transmission of the **current astrological l
 andscape**—translating what’s happening in the sky into real guidance 
 for navigating your life right now. Find out what Uranus (the Liberator) N
 eptune (the divine doorway) Pluto (deep Desires) and Jupiter (Social Awarn
 ess) into Inner wisdom is being transmitted for your true calling and plac
 e on earth and your future role in it.\nFrom there\, you’ll be guided in
 to a **deep\, multidimensional sound journey**.\nSurrounded by the resonan
 ce of **multiple gongs\, crystal and Tibetan bowls\, handpan\, and other h
 armonic instruments**\, your body becomes the receiver… and the field be
 gins to shift.\nThis is not just something you hear—\n**it’s something
  you feel\, something you enter.**\n\\#\\#\\# 🔊 **The Experience**\nAs 
 the gong waves move through you:\n\n* The nervous system begins to **downs
 hift and unwind**\n* The mind softens\, releasing control\n* The body open
 s into **deep cellular resonance**\n* Stagnant energy begins to **move\, r
 elease\, and reorganize**\n* This time we are fresh off a full moon in Aqu
 arius and the energies are still strong\n\nMany describe the experience as
  entering a **dreamlike\, timeless state**—\nwhere insight\, emotion\, a
 nd clarity arise naturally from within.\nThe sound doesn’t guide you som
 ewhere else…\n**it brings you deeper into yourself.**\n\n🌌 **Why This
  Now**\n2026 is not a passive year—it is revolutionary- an evolutionary 
 leap is here now.\nWe are being asked to **trust ourselves at a deeper lev
 el**\, to move without certainty\, and to listen inward more than ever bef
 ore.\nSound—especially the gong—has a unique ability to **bypass the t
 hinking mind** and reconnect you with your own internal guidance system.\n
 This journey is an opportunity to:\n\n* Reset your energetic field\n* Reco
 nnect with your intuition\n* Realign with your inner rhythm\n* Sudden insi
 ght and clarity\n\n\\#\\#\\# 🌀 **What is Sound Healing?**\nSound healin
 g works through **vibrational resonance**.\nThe rich\, non-linear overtone
 s of instruments like the gong interact directly with the body’s energet
 ic and physical systems—supporting:\n\n* Relaxation and nervous system r
 egulation\n* Emotional release\n* Energetic clearing and activation\n* Exp
 anded states of awareness\n\nYou don’t need to “do” anything—\nsim
 ply **lie down\, receive\, and allow**.\nPrice is by Donation starting at 
 $22. Please give what you can.\nYou can Donate w credit card here or at Ve
 mno @Starsounds\nCash is okay at the door\, please let us know you coming.
 ..email [David@starsounds.love](mailto:David@starsounds.love)\n\nGet your 
 tickets here: [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.love/event-details/gong
 -sound-journey-astrology-transmission)\n\n🧘 **What to Bring**\nYoga mat
  • Blanket • Pillow • Water • Anything for comfort\n**See You Ther
 e**\n\n👤 **About David Heiss**\nDavid Heiss is an **Evolutionary Astrol
 oger and Sound Alchemist** devoted to guiding himself and others into deep
 er self-awareness through vibration and cosmic insight.\nSince 2012\, he h
 as worked with the transformative power of **gongs and astrology**\, follo
 wing a profound awakening that shifted his life toward a path of healing a
 nd inner discovery.\nHis work blends:\n\n* **Astrological intelligence** (
 understanding your soul’s path)\n* **Sound immersion** (direct vibration
 al experience)\n\nCreating a space where participants can **remember who t
 hey are on a deeper level**.\nHis intention is simple and precise: to help
  you **experience yourself more fully**.
