SUMMARY:✨ Gong Sound Immersion in the Dome ✨with David Heiss✨
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Star Sounds with David Heiss**\n**Speci
 alizing in Astrological Events and Sound Healing Journeys**\nStep into the
  energy of Mars and Venus with Sound and deep restoration\, reflection\, a
 nd vibrational alignment at the beautiful Light Center in Black Mountain\,
  NC.\n\nRegister Here $30 [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.love/event-
 details/gong-sound-immersion-in-the-dome-with-david-heiss)\n\nAs we move t
 hrough the heart of Leo Season w **Lions Gate** approaching\, Mars in Gemi
 ni forms a dynamic square to Venus in Virgo\, creating a tension between t
 he mind and the heart\, curiosity and commitment\, movement and meaning.\n
 Mars in Gemini can scatter our energy in many directions\, while Venus in 
 Virgo seeks clarity\, refinement\, and purpose. Together they invite us to
  examine where we may be overthinking\, over analyzing\, or divided betwee
 n what we desire and what truly nourishes us.\nThis immersive gong sound j
 ourney offers an opportunity to step beyond mental noise and reconnect wit
 h a deeper inner rhythm. The rich vibrations of gongs\, singing bowls\, an
 d sacred sound create space for relaxation\, insight\, and nervous system 
 restoration.\nJoin David Heiss for an evening of sound\, stillness\, and r
 enewal as we explore the balance between thought and feeling\, action and 
 wisdom\, under the radiant fire of Leo Season.\n**Come as you are. Leave a
  little lighter.**\nThis special gathering invites you into a meditative s
 ound journey designed to calm the nervous system\, quiet the noise of the 
 outer world\, and awaken clarity within.\nThrough the immersive tones of g
 ongs\, singing bowls\, and healing frequencies\, we will create space to r
 elease mental overload\, reconnect with intuition\, and align with the cha
 nging energies of this pivotal time.\nHeld in the peaceful mountain energy
  of the Light Center\, this experience is both grounding and expansive... 
 an invitation to slow down\, breathe deeply\, and listen inward.\nCome as 
 you are. **Bring a yoga mat\, blanket\, pillow\, water\, and anything need
 ed to remain comfortable while lying down during the sound immersion.**\n*
 *The evening will begin with a brief astrology transmission exploring the 
 deeper meaning of Venus and Mars**\, illuminating the dance between desire
  and discernment\, movement and meaning\, heart and mind. We will then jou
 rney into an immersive gong sound healing **In the Dome** featuring severa
 l gongs\, crystal and Tibetan bowls\, and other deeply resonant instrument
 s designed to calm the mind\, awaken the spirit\, and realign the nervous 
 system with the rhythms of nature and cosmos.\n**This will be an afternoon
  of stillness\, wonder\, activation\, and connection beneath the living sk
 y with Sound.**\nCome ready to listen\nCome ready to receive\nCome ready t
 o remember\n\nRegister Here $30 [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.love/
 event-details/gong-sound-immersion-in-the-dome-with-david-heiss)\n\n👤 *
 *About David Heiss**\nDavid Heiss is an **Evolutionary Astrologer and Soun
 d Alchemist** devoted to guiding others into deeper self-awareness through
  vibration and cosmic insight.\nSince 2012\, he has worked with the transf
 ormative power of **gongs and astrology**\, following a profound awakening
  that shifted his life toward a path of healing and inner discovery.\nHis 
 work blends:\n\n* **Astrological intelligence** (understanding your soul
 ’s path)\n* **Sound immersion** (direct vibrational experience)\n\nCreat
 ing a space where participants can **remember who they are on a deeper lev
 el**.\nHis intention is simple and precise: to help you **experience yours
 elf more fully**.\nSign up here: $30 [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.
 love/event-details/gong-sound-immersion-in-the-dome-with-david-heiss)\n**T
 ickets: $30 in advance\; day of event $35**
